1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:03,663
Rita: Morning, Phil. Give me a sec to get my bearings.

2
00:00:04,732 --> 00:00:11,225
Larry: Rita, if the newsroom wants festival footage, this is the one I've got to make count. Rolling now.

3
00:00:12,295 --> 00:00:22,064
Phil: Rita, it's Tuesday again. I need a straight answer: are we wrapped, or is the camera still rolling? I've got a coach to catch.

4
00:00:23,108 --> 00:00:26,297
Phil: I'm done here. I'm heading to the depot.

5
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:40,920
Phil: Hey, it's Phil. I finally made it to Pittsburgh. I'm safe. I'm just calling to make sure I'm still on for Wednesday. I'm free to help move that couch.

6
00:00:45,482 --> 00:00:48,726
Rita: Morning, Phil. Give me a sec to get my bearings.

7
00:00:53,295 --> 00:00:59,664
Phil: Rita, I'm going to mark the window with a pencil so I can tell this Tuesday from the last one.

8
00:01:16,795 --> 00:01:22,864
Phil: Rita, I'm not going back to that room. I'm grabbing a plate and clearing this spot.

9
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:27,456
Phil: Rita, I'm out. See you in Pittsburgh.

10
00:01:28,545 --> 00:01:33,273
Phil: Finally. Pittsburgh. I can smell the river from here.

